  2230	
  2231	    Never copied from a real envelope (codex P2-2): the validator is itself
  2232	    listed in pair-rail-inputs-hash-manifest.txt, so the P1-4 cure CHANGES the
  2233	    expected hash. A hardcoded hex would make the green cases fail on
  2234	    inputs_hash and the test would prove nothing about the decision.
